# ----- agent work -----
#
# The run loop, in the order you call it:
#
#   cms work                claim one queued run (exit 3 = nothing queued)
#   cms run-start <id>      say you've begun
#   cms run-step <id> …     narrate as you go; also the heartbeat
#   cms run-ping <id>       heartbeat with nothing to say
#   cms run-done <id> …     finished, with a summary
#   cms run-fail <id> …     didn't finish, with the reason
#
# A run whose lease lapses goes back on the queue for someone else, so the
# heartbeat is not optional in a long run.

